 "reference": "Schunck, Magistri, Marcuzzi, Nardi, Nunes, Behley, Stachniss, PLoS ONE 16(8) e0256340 (2021)",
 "method": "Non-rigid Coherent Point Drift with rigid pre-alignment",
 "units": "scan units",
 "unit_evidence": "Not stated by the Pheno4D documentation, which describes the files only as x, y, z and a label. Probably millimetres — the scanner is a Perceptron ScanWorks V5 on a ROMER Infinite 2.0 arm (σ ≈ 0.012 mm), which reports in mm, and the plants then stand 26–47 cm. Recorded as an inference and not applied.",
